[2502] [2026-01-15 16:29:19] [INFO] [ENGINE]  <--------- ENGINE SEND: COMATE_AGENT_UPDATE_MESSAGE {"data":{"type":"partial-message-data","conversationInfo":{"id":"977ec667-0cb2-40af-8a72-830f099162d2","status":"Completed","type":"E2EBotConversation","utime":1768465759692,"ctime":1768457254193},"messages":[{"id":"d375e8ab-01fb-49aa-a744-f96dc6635170","discard":false,"userMessageId":"14949459","reportedId":"9e62428f-9d97-4d93-9d8c-4601b777f880","agentInfo":{"avatar":"zulu","name":"Zulu"},"role":"assistant","status":"success","tokenUsage":{"usagePercentage":78.07,"contextUsed":66622,"contextLimit":85333,"needCompression":true,"savedPercentage":0},"content":{},"elements":[{"id":"f2024766-8e5f-4540-89cc-0a2f524fcf2a","type":"TEXT","status":"success","content":"在不考虑缓存的情况下，我将专注于数据库操作优化和代码逻辑重构。以下是针对`ApprovalFundVoucherServiceImpl`的优化方案：\n\n## 🔍 核心优化点分析\n\n1. **数据库查询优化**（149ms）\n2. **状态校验逻辑优化**（28ms）\n3. **批量操作优化**（131ms）\n\n## 🛠️ 具体优化方案\n\n### 1. 数据库查询优化（高优先级）\n**问题**：单条查询导致多次数据库往返\n```java\n// 当前代码\nTmsLoanAccountExample example = new TmsLoanAccountExample();\nexample.createCriteria().andAttribute3EqualTo(headerId);\nList<TmsLoanAccount> accounts = loanAccountDAO.selectByExample(example); // 149ms\n```\n\n**优化方案**：\n```java\n// 修改为批量查询（需DAO层支持）\nList<Long> headerIds = Arrays.asList(queryDTO.getAccountHeaderId());\nMap<Long, List<TmsLoanAccount>> accountMap = loanAccountDAO.selectByHeaderIds(headerIds); // 新增批量方法\n```\n\n需新增DAO方法：\n```xml\n<!-- LoanAccountDAO.xml -->\n<select id=\"selectByHeaderIds\" resultMap=\"BaseResultMap\">\n    SELECT * FROM tms_loan_account \n    WHERE attribute3 IN\n    <foreach collection=\"list\" item=\"id\" open=\"(\" separator=\",\" close=\")\">\n        #{id}\n    </foreach>\n</select>\n```\n\n### 2. 状态校验优化（中优先级）\n**问题**：重复验证和多余的对象创建\n```java\n// 当前代码\ncheckStatus(headerIds, firstAudit); // 28ms\n```\n\n**优化方案**：\n```java\n// 合并到主流程中\nboolean isValid = accounts.stream()\n    .allMatch(acc -> firstAudit ? \n        \"P\".equals(acc.getApproveStatus()) : \n        \"A\".equals(acc.getApproveStatus()));\n```\n\n### 3. 批量操作优化（高优先级）\n**问题**：多次单条更新\n```java\n// 当前finalAudit方法内部可能包含循环更新\nfor (TmsLoanAccount account : accounts) {\n    account.setApproveStatus(\"Y\");\n    loanAccountDAO.updateByPrimaryKey(account); // 低效\n}\n```\n\n**优化方案**：\n```java\n// 使用批量更新\nList<Long> accountIds = accounts.stream()\n    .map(TmsLoanAccount::getAccountId)\n    .collect(Collectors.toList());\n    \nloanAccountDAO.batchUpdateStatus(accountIds, \"Y\", currentUser); // 新增批量方法\n```\n\n需新增DAO方法：\n```xml\n<!-- LoanAccountDAO.xml -->\n<update id=\"batchUpdateStatus\">\n    UPDATE tms_loan_account\n    SET approve_status = #{status},\n        last_updated_by = #{username},\n        last_update_date = NOW()\n    WHERE account_id IN\n    <foreach collection=\"accountIds\" item=\"id\" open=\"(\" separator=\",\" close=\")\">\n        #{id}\n    </foreach>\n</update>\n```\n\n## 📊 预期性能对比\n\n| 操作类型       | 当前耗时 | 优化后预期 | 提升幅度 |\n|----------------|----------|------------|----------|\n| 主查询         | 149ms    | 50ms       | 66%      |\n| 状态校验       | 28ms     | 5ms        | 82%      |\n| 批量更新       | 131ms    | 30ms       | 77%      |\n| **总耗时**     | **308ms**| **85ms**   | **72%**  |\n\n## 🔧 实施步骤建议\n\n1. **先实现DAO层批量方法**：\n   ```xml\n   <!-- 在LoanAccountDAO.xml中添加 -->\n   <select id=\"selectByHeaderIds\" resultMap=\"BaseResultMap\">...</select>\n   <update id=\"batchUpdateStatus\">...</update>\n   ```\n\n2. **重构服务层逻辑**：\n   ```java\n   public void afterBpmCompleteActivity(ApproveFundVoucherQueryDTO queryDTO, boolean firstAudit) {\n       // 1. 批量查询\n       List<Long> headerIds = Collections.singletonList(queryDTO.getAccountHeaderId());\n       Map<Long, List<TmsLoanAccount>> accountMap = loanAccountDAO.selectByHeaderIds(headerIds);\n       \n       // 2. 合并校验\n       boolean isValid = accountMap.get(queryDTO.getAccountHeaderId()).stream()\n           .allMatch(acc -> validateStatus(acc, firstAudit));\n       \n       // 3. 批量操作\n       if (isValid) {\n           List<Long> accountIds = accountMap.values().stream()\n               .flatMap(List::stream)\n               .map(TmsLoanAccount::getAccountId)\n               .collect(Collectors.toList());\n               \n           loanAccountDAO.batchUpdateStatus(accountIds, \n               firstAudit ? \"A\" : \"F\", \n               SecurityUtils.getCurrentUser());\n       }\n   }\n   ```\n\n需要我为您实现上述任何一个具体优化步骤吗？或者您希望先看到哪个部分的详细代码？","composer":{"markdown":"","tasks":[]},"discard":false,"isErrorMessage":false,"parentMessageId":"","retryMessageId":"6968a52c100b6b719ec856f7"}]}]}}
